{"unit_id":"Zalpha263__dsh-ui-beautify#card-1","repo":"Zalpha263/dsh-ui-beautify","commit":"5c2d286ddc1f4bd41d343d67bf649121888bf2e6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-beautify 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的外观主题插件，在设置中的「UI设置」加入外观面板。它通过 theme token 和样式注入调整界面配色，并用 slots 注册设置入口。主要功能包括切换默认、深海蓝、暖沙和松石绿配色，适配浅色与深色主题，上传整页背景图片，以及清除背景或重置全部外观。图片在浏览器本地压缩并保存，刷新后可恢复。适合希望个性化 DSH 网页界面且不需要额外账号或 API 密钥的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:137-154","lib/client.js:273-306","lib/client.js:358-398"]}
{"unit_id":"Zalpha263__dsh-ui-beautify#card-2","repo":"Zalpha263/dsh-ui-beautify","commit":"5c2d286ddc1f4bd41d343d67bf649121888bf2e6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ui-beautify adds an appearance panel to DSH Web UI Settings. Choose four light and dark color presets, upload or clear a full-page background image, or reset the appearance. Images are resized and saved in browser storage for restoration after refresh. No account or API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:137-154","lib/client.js:273-306","lib/client.js:358-398"]}
