{"unit_id":"Zalpha263__dsh-ui-beautify#feature-1","repo":"Zalpha263/dsh-ui-beautify","commit":"5c2d286ddc1f4bd41d343d67bf649121888bf2e6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-beautify 的功能「配色预设」：设置 → UI设置里的配色预设按钮可切换默认、深海蓝、暖沙或松石绿方案；插件将对应的主题 token 和按钮样式应用到界面，并为浅色与深色模式分别提供颜色。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:24-90","lib/client.js:358-362"]}
{"unit_id":"Zalpha263__dsh-ui-beautify#feature-2","repo":"Zalpha263/dsh-ui-beautify","commit":"5c2d286ddc1f4bd41d343d67bf649121888bf2e6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-beautify 的功能「自定义背景图」：在 UI设置选择本地图片后，插件读取图片并尝试缩放至最长边 2560 像素，再将其作为侧边栏和主区域背景；用户可点击清除移除背景。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:273-307","lib/client.js:363-368"]}
{"unit_id":"Zalpha263__dsh-ui-beautify#feature-3","repo":"Zalpha263/dsh-ui-beautify","commit":"5c2d286ddc1f4bd41d343d67bf649121888bf2e6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-beautify 的功能「恢复与重置外观」：插件把当前配色和背景图保存在浏览器 localStorage，并在载入时恢复；「重置全部」恢复默认配色并清除背景，卸载清理逻辑会移除注入的样式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:179-270","lib/client.js:309-316","lib/client.js:383-390"]}
{"unit_id":"Zalpha263__dsh-ui-beautify#feature-4","repo":"Zalpha263/dsh-ui-beautify","commit":"5c2d286ddc1f4bd41d343d67bf649121888bf2e6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-beautify 的功能「UI设置入口」：插件通过 settings.section slot 注册「UI设置」区段，并在其中显示外观面板。用户从 DSH 设置界面即可选择配色、上传或清除背景，以及重置外观。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:358-398"]}
{"unit_id":"Zalpha263__dsh-ui-beautify#caveat-1","repo":"Zalpha263/dsh-ui-beautify","commit":"5c2d286ddc1f4bd41d343d67bf649121888bf2e6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-beautify 使用浏览器 localStorage 保存配色和背景图片数据；更换浏览器或清理浏览器存储后，这些自定义外观不会保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:139","lib/client.js:180-208","lib/client.js:229-270"]}
